      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article analyzes literature on pain management programs in hand therapy. Philosophical and practical issues that may influence the approach to pain are reviewed. Possible explanations for the relative lack of interdisciplinary/comprehensive approaches to pain are put forth. Conditions under which more comprehensive treatment should be considered are discussed."},
